Note on data provenance:

The default build of this project produces a database derived entirely from
US government data sources (Census Bureau, NCES, MA DESE).  Government data
is public domain and not subject to this license.

The optional --non-free build mode scrapes GreatSchools ratings, which are
subject to GreatSchools' own terms of service and cannot be redistributed.
Do not distribute databases built with --non-free.
